  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "VRChat is full of screaming kids and all kinds of trolls on random accounts, it creates a really toxic and unpleasant environment for everyone, turning new players away from the game, as well as keeping long-time players away from public rooms.\nThis is where Verification comes in, there should be a simple verification system + Verified/Unverified lobbies\nThis could for example be making a VRChat account + linking a phone number to it. Something that everyone who wants to could EASILY do, but would stop screaming kids who just got the game or trolls creating random accounts dead in their tracks, separating them from the verified players\nThen when a public instance is created, you'd have the option to make a verified / unverified instance, any other instance types would be unaffected.",
